OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton's scheme to send free
OL,4,Abooks to children brought back
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scheme set up by the late country
OL,7,Fsinger Dolly Parton, which posts a free
OL,8,Fbook to children every month until
OL,9,Ftheir fifth birthday, has relaunched in
OL,10,Fparts of Wales.
OL,12,FParton, who died aged 80 in August, was
OL,13,Finspired by her father who could not
OL,14,Fread or write.
OL,16,FShe set up the Imagination Library in
OL,17,F1995 and it has been rolled out in
OL,18,Fcountries across the world.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
